+  python vmaf_calculator.py -r ref.mp4 -d dist.mp4 -m vmaf_phone
+
+  # Use 4K model for 4K content
+  python vmaf_calculator.py -r ref.mp4 -d dist.mp4 -m vmaf_4k
+
+Model Selection:
+  vmaf_v0.6.1  - Default model for HD content on TV/laptop (3H viewing distance)
+  vmaf_4k      - Optimized for 4K/UHD content on 4K TV (1.5H viewing distance)
